稳态预测协方差满足
\begin{equation}
  \begin{aligned}
  \bm\Pi={}&\bm A\bm\Pi\bm A^\top+\bm\Sigma_{\mathrm w}\\
     &-\bm A\bm\Pi\bm C^\top
